// What the FLATLINED screen says to a runner who died with perma death on: one line,
// picked by the run, in pink where the way back would be. Short, lowercase, and on
// the street's side, not the runner's. Not a word about the HALL OF FAME.
(
    taunts: [
        "somebody's already wearing your jacket.",
        "your rent's still due.",
        "should've stayed in bed.",
        "the street forgot you before you hit the floor.",
        "the ICE didn't even slow down.",
        "they'll sell your chrome by morning.",
    ],
)
